<Draft>
<Para>
<Text>Draft Order in Council laid before Parliament under section 10(1) of the International Organisations Act <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/1968/48" id="c00001" Year="1968" Number="48" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct">1968 (c. 48)</Citation>, for approval by resolution of each House of Parliament.</Text>
